note top of PaymentStrategy : <b>Strategy 1 - payment</b>\nContext: MonetaryDonation\n(setPaymentStrategy at runtime)
note top of NotificationStrategy : <b>Strategy 2 - communication channel</b>\nContext: NotificationService picks the\nstrategy from each recipient's preferred channel
note top of ImpactEvaluationStrategy : <b>Strategy 3 - impact evaluation</b>\nContext: ImpactEvaluator (setStrategy)
EducationImpactStrategy -[hidden]down- MonetaryDonation
CheckPayment -[hidden]down- NotificationService
@enduml
